#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\privacy.html:47
msgid "What we do with your data"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\privacy.html:50
msgid ""
"We collect and process personal data in order to: create and maintain your "
"account; verify your identity; register historical assets and their "
"locations; process purchase orders; issue and verify certified documents; "
"send you the communications the service requires; comply with legal "
"obligations; and keep the platform secure."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\privacy.html:62
msgid ""
"Where sensitive data is requested, you are not obliged to give it, and you "
"will be told which data it is and what it is for before it is collected."
