msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\privacy.html:84
msgid ""
"Through the PQRS form on this site. Each request gets a reference number and "
"a due date at the moment it is filed: queries are answered within 10 "
"business days and claims within 15, in both cases counted from the day after "
"the request comes in."
