#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:23
#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:24
msgid "Terms and conditions"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:30
msgid ""
"A starting point, not approved terms. The sections on what a certification "
"proves and on automatic translation were written to match what the platform "
"actually does; the rest needs the firm's review, and the dispute resolution "
"section in particular needs a decision, not just a redraft."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:39
msgid "Who we are and what this is"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:42
msgid ""
"GEA is the platform operated by Propensiones Abogados for managing "
"historical assets — bonds, gold, high denomination banknotes and similar — "
"and for issuing and verifying certified documents. By creating an account or "
"using the platform you accept these terms."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:50
msgid "Who may use it"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:53
msgid ""
"The platform is for adults with legal capacity. Registration requires a code "
"supplied by the firm: it is not open sign-up, and an account is personal and "
"non-transferable. You are responsible for what is done from your account, "
"which is why a second factor is available and required for internal roles."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:62
msgid "What you may not do"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:65
msgid "Register assets or documents you have no right over."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:66
msgid "Upload content that is unlawful, or that infringes third party rights."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:67
msgid "Try to reach data or areas that do not correspond to your role."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:68
msgid "Automate access, scan the platform, or interfere with its operation."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:69
msgid ""
"Present a certified copy as if it were something other than what section 5 "
"describes."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:72
msgid "Your content"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:75
msgid ""
"What you upload stays yours. You give Propensiones the permission needed to "
"store it, process it and show it to whoever the platform's rules allow, for "
"the purpose you uploaded it for. You are responsible for having the right to "
"upload it."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:83
msgid "What a certification proves — and what it does not"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:86
msgid "This is the section to read twice."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:87
msgid ""
"A GEA certification proves <b>integrity</b>: that a file has not changed "
"since it was registered, and that it existed no later than a given moment. "
"It says nothing about whether what the document claims is <b>true</b>, nor "
"about the authenticity, ownership, value or legal validity of any asset it "
"describes."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:97
msgid ""
"In concrete terms: certifying a document that states an asset is worth a "
"certain amount proves that the document said so on that date. It does not "
"verify the amount, the asset, or the claim. The certification record issued "
"with every document says the same thing in its own terms, and that record "
"governs over any summary of it."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:107
msgid ""
"Presenting a certified document as if it proved the truth of its contents is "
"a misuse of the service, and Propensiones may cancel a certification and "
"close the account of anyone who does so."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:114
msgid "Automatic features, stated plainly"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:119
msgid ""
"Names and descriptions are translated between Spanish and English by an "
"automated system, without human review. It is a convenience for reading, not "
"a certified or sworn translation, and it may be wrong. Where a text has "
"legal or contractual effect, the version written by its author is the one "
"that governs. Do not rely on a machine translation for a decision that "
"matters."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:129
msgid "Time anchoring"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:132
msgid ""
"Certain documents are anchored in time using a timestamping authority and "
"the Bitcoin blockchain. What is published is only a cryptographic hash — "
"never the document, and never its content. The anchor proves that a given "
"file existed no later than a certain moment. It proves nothing about who "
"wrote it, whether it is true, or what it is worth."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:142
msgid ""
"Anchoring in a block is not instantaneous: proofs are issued pending and "
"mature over the following hours. A document is fully usable in the meantime; "
"the anchoring page shows the current state at any time."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:149
msgid "Availability"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:152
msgid ""
"We work to keep the platform available, but we do not guarantee "
"uninterrupted service. Maintenance, third party failures and causes outside "
"our control may interrupt it. Nothing here creates a service level "
"commitment unless it has been agreed separately in writing."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:160
msgid "Copyright and takedown"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:163
msgid ""
"We respect intellectual property. If you believe content on the platform "
"infringes your copyright, send a notice to the address in section 14 "
"including: your signature; identification of the protected work; "
"identification of the material you say infringes it and where it is; your "
"contact details; a statement that you believe in good faith that the use is "
"unauthorised; and a statement that the information is accurate and that you "
"are entitled to act on behalf of the rights holder."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:176
msgid ""
"Material that is the subject of a valid notice is removed promptly, and "
"accounts that repeatedly infringe may be terminated. Whoever uploaded the "
"material is told, and may reply."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:185
msgid ""
"The DMCA is United States law, and its safe harbour protects providers "
"subject to that jurisdiction; registering an agent with the US Copyright "
"Office only makes sense if the service is offered there. In Colombia the "
"applicable framework is Law 23 of 1982 and Law 1915 of 2018. A takedown "
"procedure is worth having either way — this one — but calling it \"DMCA\" "
"does not by itself bring the safe harbour with it."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:195
msgid "Suspension and termination"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:198
msgid ""
"We may suspend or close an account that breaches these terms. Closing an "
"account does not delete certifications already issued, nor the audit trail: "
"both have to survive for the platform to keep doing what it is for. Section "
"9 of the data policy explains why."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:206
msgid "Liability"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:209
msgid ""
"Propensiones is liable for its own wilful misconduct and gross negligence, "
"as the applicable law provides. It is not liable for decisions taken on the "
"basis of an automatic translation, nor for the use a third party makes of a "
"certified document contrary to section 5, nor for the content that users "
"themselves upload."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:218
msgid "Personal data"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:221
msgid ""
"Handling of personal data is governed by the personal data processing "
"policy, which forms part of these terms."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:225
msgid "Read the data policy"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:228
msgid "Governing law and disputes"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:231
msgid ""
"These terms are governed by Colombian law. Any dispute shall first be raised "
"through the PQRS form, so that it can be resolved directly. If it is not "
"resolved, the parties may attempt conciliation before an authorised "
"conciliation centre before going to court. Failing that, the dispute goes "
"before the ordinary Colombian courts."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:241
msgid "Note for review: the arbitration clause does not port."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:243
msgid ""
"The standard United States clause — binding individual arbitration before "
"AAA or JAMS, waiver of jury trial, waiver of class actions — is not a matter "
"of swapping the administrator for a local one:"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:250
msgid ""
"There is no jury in Colombian civil procedure, so that waiver means nothing."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:251
msgid ""
"Group and class actions are governed by Law 472 of 1998 and are of "
"constitutional rank; they are not waived in an adhesion contract."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:252
msgid ""
"In consumer matters the Superintendence of Industry and Commerce holds "
"jurisdiction under Law 1480 of 2011, and a clause that tries to close that "
"door risks being held abusive and ineffective."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:253
msgid ""
"Real arbitration here runs under Law 1563 of 2012, before a chamber of "
"commerce arbitration centre, at a cost that only makes sense above a certain "
"amount in dispute."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:256
msgid ""
"What is written above is a graduated clause — direct claim, conciliation, "
"then courts — which is the usual arrangement here. If the firm wants "
"arbitration, it belongs in the contracts signed with counterparties for "
"specific transactions, with its seat, rules and amount threshold set out, "
"rather than in the general terms of a platform."
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\common\core\templates\core\tyc\terms.html:270
msgid ""
"We may modify these terms. Material changes are notified through the "
"platform or by email, with the date they come into force. The version and "
"date at the top say which text is in force."
msgstr ""

